      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. so for the actual lesson activity, maybe we could have a section where we look at how these regressive attitudes are usually based on outdated or incorrect ideas. can you suggest some ways i can frame that for 12 year olds so they see why these movements are actually problematic rather than just having different opinions?",
